+
+Lock one exact donor version and maintain:
+
+```text
+Docs/Phase1/LEGACY_FEATURE_PARITY_MATRIX.csv
+Docs/Phase1/PHASE1_SCOPE_LOCK.md
+Docs/Phase1/PHASE2_BACKLOG.md
